{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788336567886653001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"rubellite-condensed-bettong","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"548b0c6ed11bf764d4114c62f9e170cd91efde8dc5cfa1883275e5bd6f3af39a","event_uuid":"366f4732-6859-4031-9686-b0fe5d20df25","position":{"commit_sha":"65774676ca38347779566f2e28c6b2098dc26e39","position":"1788330600560697001-366f4732-6859-4031-9686-b0fe5d20df25"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"4a1118187e4e3c822897689461aa50967769acecfd9588be3ecdf240a1885212","event_uuid":"56495192-45dd-46dc-bceb-ffaf2f14d0ff","position":{"commit_sha":"02b78f4b0ee9f48c1930c7e292714fc6ba71b33e","position":"1788330607160756001-56495192-45dd-46dc-bceb-ffaf2f14d0ff"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788330600560697001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"56495192-45dd-46dc-bceb-ffaf2f14d0ff","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"15f2-f3d4-ffcd-4223"}],"description":"Three follow-ups on the unit-tier subprocess-isolation guard, all raised as non-blocking advisories\nby the LLM code review on Gerrit 2506 and deferred there.\n\n1. _check_home_escape may OVER-FLAG. It treats any argv element referencing a name or attribute in\n   _HOME_ESCAPE_NAMES (home, mkdtemp, TemporaryDirectory) as a hazard. An unrelated local named\n   `home`, or a tmp_path-rooted mkdtemp that is perfectly harnessed, would be reported. Zero live\n   sites hit it today, so it is latent rather than active — but the guard s whole design premise is\n   that a false positive is as costly as a false negative, because reddening innocent files is how a\n   guard gets reverted. Narrow it to the attribute forms that actually escape (Path.home(),\n   os.environ[\"HOME\"]) and add both a positive and a negative case.\n2. The UsageError contract is verified only by GREPPING conftest.py text for the string within a\n   window. That asserts the source, not the behaviour: it would pass if the arm raised something\n   else while the word appeared nearby. The contract matters (from the xdist controller a\n   pytest.fail escapes as a 20-line INTERNALERROR), so it deserves a real assertion on the raised\n   type.\n3. The file-level opt-out fallback for hazards found in MODULE-LEVEL HELPERS is untested. That path\n   exists so a marked test s shared helper is covered when the finding carries no test name of its\n   own; five live sites rely on it via a module pytestmark. It was verified once by hand during\n   implementation and never pinned.\n\nSee tests/_subprocess_isolation.py and tests/unit/test_collection_isolation_guard.py.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"c678-e73c-b48a-4bbe","ticket_type":"task","title":"Narrow the isolation guard's home-escape rule and pin two untested contracts","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["366f4732-6859-4031-9686-b0fe5d20df25","56495192-45dd-46dc-bceb-ffaf2f14d0ff"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788336567886653001,"uuid":"07544196-3f6f-4c85-87ef-9390e9cdfadc"}